## Summary

**Root Cause**: Assuming Carbon exports exist without verification.

**Solution**: Always verify exports exist before using them.

**Impact**: Zero runtime errors when following verification process.

**Key Takeaway**: Spend 30 seconds verifying exports to save 30 minutes debugging runtime errors.
